title: "Definograph: visual reading of Lean mathematical statements"
type: software
version: 0.7.1
date-released: 2026-09-19
authors:
  - given-names: Neil Yuanting
    family-names: Li
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A local Lean-backed application for reading mathematical statements through
  typed constructions, scoped visual sequences, and symbolic geometry.
  Built for CS 124 at UIUC. The 0.7 prototype was developed by Codex; the architecture decision and further development are by Claude; both under the supervision of Neil Yuanting Li.
repository-code: "https://github.com/N-Y-L/definograph"
